REGIONAL REGULATION OF BANDUNG CITY

NUMBER 7 OF 2025

CONCERNING

EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF BANDUNG,

Considering:

a. that women have a strategic position as an asset of the nation, therefore the empowerment and protection of women must be carried out in an integrated and sustainable manner through the acceleration of fulfilling the empowerment and protection of women in social, national and state life;
b. that every woman has the right to survival, to grow, to develop and to obtain protection from threats of fear, treatment that degrades dignity, self-worth, human dignity and has the right to obtain access to and control over economic, political, social, and cultural resources, so that women can play a role and participate actively in social life;
c. that to guarantee legal certainty in the implementation of empowerment and protection of women as well as carrying out mandatory regional government affairs, it is necessary to have regulations in a Regional Regulation;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Empowerment and Protection of Women;

In view of:

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
