NUMBER 7 OF 2025

CONCERNING

EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF BANDUNG,

Considering:

a. that women have a strategic position as an asset of the nation, therefore the empowerment and protection of women must be carried out in an integrated and sustainable manner through the acceleration of fulfilling the empowerment and protection of women in social, national and state life;
