8. Placement of victims in temporary shelter by taking into account:
a. the level of threat to the victim that endangers life;
b. security and safety of the victim;
c. acceleration of handling and recovery of the victim;
d. ease of access in assisting the victim; and
e. preparation for the victim's return before returning to the area of origin.

Article 19

1. The Regional Government provides protection for Women victims of acts of violence carried out comprehensively and in an integrated manner.
