Part One

Article 2

The Principles of Women's Empowerment and Protection are:
a. protection;
b. non-discrimination;
c. kinship;
d. inclusiveness;
e. synergy;
f. order and legal certainty;
g. sustainability; and
h. accountability.

Article 12

